Hi,=20

Is your sched_getcpu() system call a vdso too ? This may explain the differ=
ence.=20

Moreover, make sure you #define _LGPL_SOURCE in your benchmark program=20
before including any lttng ust header. It will inline many functions associ=
ated with=20
tracepoints.=20

Then, you can try using "perf" to profile the runtime execution of your pro=
gram=20
traced by lttng-ust ? This should give us the information we need to invest=
igate the=20
performance profile.=20

Thanks,=20

Mathieu=20

